const BRANCHES=['Lekki Phase 1','Victoria Island','Ikeja City Mall','Yaba','Surulere','Ikoyi','Ajah','Maryland','Gbagada','Festac','Abuja Central','Wuse 2','Port Harcourt','Enugu','Ibadan','Kano','Benin City','Warri','Uyo','Calabar'];
const BASE_PRODUCTS=[
 {id:'jollof',name:'Party Jollof Rice',category:'Meals',emoji:'🍛',price:4200,cost:1750},
 {id:'chicken',name:'Grilled Chicken',category:'Meals',emoji:'🍗',price:3800,cost:1900},
 {id:'beef',name:'Beef Suya Wrap',category:'Meals',emoji:'🌯',price:3200,cost:1400},
 {id:'plantain',name:'Fried Plantain',category:'Sides',emoji:'🍌',price:1100,cost:380},
 {id:'stew',name:'Ofada Rice & Stew',category:'Meals',emoji:'🍚',price:3600,cost:1500},
 {id:'zobo',name:'Chilled Zobo',category:'Drinks',emoji:'🥤',price:800,cost:250},
 {id:'chin',name:'Coconut Chin Chin',category:'Packaged',emoji:'🥥',price:1500,cost:650},
 {id:'water',name:'Table Water',category:'Drinks',emoji:'💧',price:300,cost:120},
 {id:'puff',name:'Puff Puff Pack',category:'Packaged',emoji:'🍩',price:1200,cost:470}
];
const STORE_KEY='harvest-pos-v2';
const esc=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const money=n=>'₦'+Math.round(Number(n)||0).toLocaleString('en-NG');
function seededState(){
 const offsets=[1,.94,.88,.81,.79,.76,.74,.71,.69,.67,.65,.64,.62,.60,.59,.57,.56,.54,.52,.50];
 const products=BRANCHES.map((branch,bi)=>BASE_PRODUCTS.map((p,pi)=>({id:p.id,name:p.name,category:p.category,emoji:p.emoji,price:Math.round(p.price*(1+(bi%5-2)*.025)),cost:Math.round(p.cost*(1+(bi%4-1.5)*.035)),samplePrice:true,sampleCost:true,available:!(bi>1&&(bi+pi)%13===0)})));
 const sales=[];let seq=0;
 for(let b=0;b<BRANCHES.length;b++)for(let day=6;day>=0;day--){
   const date=new Date();date.setDate(date.getDate()-day);const iso=date.toISOString().slice(0,10);
   const count=Math.max(4,Math.round((12+((b*7+day*3)%17))*offsets[b]));
   for(let j=0;j<count;j++){
     const idx=(b*11+day*5+j*3)%BASE_PRODUCTS.length;const p=products[b][idx];if(!p.available)continue;
     const qty=1+(j%5===0?1:0), price=p.price,cost=p.cost;
     sales.push({id:`DEMO-${String(++seq).padStart(5,'0')}`,branch:b,date:iso,createdAt:new Date(date.getFullYear(),date.getMonth(),date.getDate(),10+(j%10),j%60).toISOString(),items:[{productId:p.id,name:p.name,emoji:p.emoji,qty,price,cost}],subtotal:price*qty,total:price*qty,payment:'Cash',channel:['Counter','Takeaway','Table service','Delivery'][j%4],status:'synced',user:'Adaeze M.',demo:true});
   }
 }
 return {products,sales,branch:0,role:'Branch Manager',user:'Adaeze M.',staff:{owner:'Chinedu O.',manager:'Adaeze M.',cashier:'Tomi A.'},view:'overview',cart:[],category:'All',payment:'Cash',paymentMethod:'Cash',paymentRef:'',period:'7d',orderChannel:'Counter',auditLog:[]};
}
function loadState(){try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORE_KEY)||localStorage.getItem('harvest-pos-v1'));if(saved&&saved.products&&saved.sales){const base=seededState();return {...base,...saved,cart:[],auditLog:saved.auditLog||[],products:saved.products.map(list=>list.map(p=>({...p,samplePrice:p.samplePrice??true,sampleCost:p.sampleCost??true})))}}}catch{}return seededState()}
let state=loadState();
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(STORE_KEY,JSON.stringify({...state,cart:[]}))}catch{toast('This browser could not save local data.','warn')}}
function branchProducts(b=state.branch){return state.products[b]||state.products[0]}
function product(id){return branchProducts().find(p=>p.id===id)}
function localISO(d=new Date()){return `${d.getFullYear()}-${String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`}
function todayISO(){return localISO()}
function dateDaysAgo(n){const d=new Date();d.setDate(d.getDate()-n);return localISO(d)}
function inPeriod(s){return state.period==='today'?s.date===todayISO():state.period==='30d'?s.date>=dateDaysAgo(29):s.date>=dateDaysAgo(6)}
function filteredSales(branch=null,includeAwaitingPayment=false){return state.sales.filter(s=>inPeriod(s)&&(branch===null||s.branch===branch)&&(includeAwaitingPayment||s.paymentStatus!=='pending'))}
function aggregate(sales){return sales.filter(s=>s.paymentStatus!=='pending').reduce((a,s)=>{a.sales+=s.total;a.cost+=s.items.reduce((n,i)=>n+i.cost*i.qty,0);a.units+=s.items.reduce((n,i)=>n+i.qty,0);a.orders++;return a},{sales:0,cost:0,units:0,orders:0})}
function grossProfit(s){return s.items.reduce((n,i)=>n+(i.price-i.cost)*i.qty,0)}
function logChange(action,productName,field,oldValue,newValue){state.auditLog=state.auditLog||[];state.auditLog.unshift({at:new Date().toISOString(),user:state.user,role:state.role,branch:state.branch,action,product:productName,field,oldValue,newValue});state.auditLog=state.auditLog.slice(0,100)}
function fmtDate(iso){return new Date(iso+'T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString('en-NG',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'})}
function labelDate(iso){return new Date(iso+'T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString('en-NG',{weekday:'short'})}
function getRole(){return state.role}
function setHeader(){
 document.getElementById('activeBranchName').textContent=state.branch===-1?'All branches':BRANCHES[state.branch];
 document.getElementById('userName').textContent=state.user;document.getElementById('userRole').textContent=state.role;
 const offline=!navigator.onLine;document.getElementById('networkPill').classList.toggle('offline',offline);document.getElementById('networkText').textContent=offline?'Offline':'Online';
 const queued=state.sales.filter(s=>s.status==='pending').length;document.getElementById('syncDot').classList.toggle('pending',queued>0||offline);
 document.getElementById('syncText').textContent=offline?'Working offline':'Browser-only mode';document.getElementById('syncSub').textContent=queued?'Offline sales queued · server sync not configured':'Sales stay on this device';
 document.getElementById('syncButton').style.display=queued?'inline':'none';document.getElementById('syncButton').title='Server sync is not configured';
 const canOwner=state.role==='Owner';document.querySelector('[data-view="overview"]').style.display='';document.querySelector('[data-view="branches"]').style.display=canOwner?'':'none';document.querySelector('[data-view="assistant"]').style.display=state.role==='Cashier'?'none':'';if(state.role==='Cashier'&&state.view==='assistant')state.view='overview';
}
function setView(view){if(view==='products'&&state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch<0)state.branch=0;state.view=view;document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('active',n.dataset.view===view));const labels={overview:'Overview',checkout:'New sale',sales:'Sales history',products:'Products & prices',branches:'Branches',assistant:'Financial assistant'};document.getElementById('pageCrumb').textContent=labels[view];render();save()}
function periodFilter(){return `<select class="select" id="periodSelect" aria-label="Date range"><option value="today" ${state.period==='today'?'selected':''}>Today</option><option value="7d" ${state.period==='7d'?'selected':''}>Last 7 days</option><option value="30d" ${state.period==='30d'?'selected':''}>Last 30 days</option></select>`}
function pageTitle(eyebrow,title,subtitle,actions=''){return `<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">${eyebrow}</div><h1>${title}</h1><p>${subtitle}</p></div>${actions?`<div class="heading-actions">${actions}</div>`:''}</div>`}
function metric(label,value,foot,icon,spark=''){return `<section class="metric-card"><div class="metric-top"><span class="metric-label">${label}</span><span class="metric-icon">${icon}</span></div><div class="metric-value">${value}</div><div class="metric-foot">${foot}</div>${spark?`<div class="metric-spark">${spark}</div>`:''}</section>`}
function sparkline(vals){const max=Math.max(...vals,1);return vals.map(v=>`<i style="height:${Math.max(16,Math.round(v/max*100))}%"></i>`).join('')}
function dayTotals(sales){return Array.from({length:7},(_,i)=>{const date=dateDaysAgo(6-i);const a=aggregate(sales.filter(s=>s.date===date));return {date,...a}})}
function salesChart(sales){const days=dayTotals(sales),max=Math.max(...days.map(d=>d.sales),1);return `<div class="chart"><div class="y-labels"><span>${money(max).replace('₦','')}</span><span>${money(max*.66).replace('₦','')}</span><span>${money(max*.33).replace('₦','')}</span><span>0</span></div><div class="chart-area"><div class="bars">${days.map((d,i)=>`<div class="bar-group"><i class="bar" style="height:${Math.max(2,d.sales/max*100)}%" title="${money(d.sales)} sales"></i><i class="bar dark" style="height:${Math.max(2,(d.sales-d.cost)/max*100)}%" title="${money(d.sales-d.cost)} gross profit"></i><span class="chart-label">${labelDate(d.date)}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></div></div>`}
function topProducts(sales,limit=5){const m={};sales.forEach(s=>s.items.forEach(i=>{if(!m[i.productId])m[i.productId]={...i,qty:0,sales:0,profit:0};m[i.productId].qty+=i.qty;m[i.productId].sales+=i.price*i.qty;m[i.productId].profit+=(i.price-i.cost)*i.qty}));return Object.values(m).sort((a,b)=>b.qty-a.qty).slice(0,limit)}
function productTableRows(items,showBranch=false){return items.map(i=>`<tr><td><div class="product-cell"><span class="product-thumb">${i.emoji||'🍽️'}</span><span><strong>${esc(i.name)}</strong><small>${i.category||'Menu item'}</small></span></div></td>${showBranch?`<td>${esc(BRANCHES[i.branch])}</td>`:''}<td>${i.qty}</td><td>${money(i.sales)}</td><td>${money(i.profit)}</td></tr>`).join('')}
function overview(){
 const owner=state.role==='Owner';let sales=filteredSales(owner&&state.branch===-1?null:state.branch);const a=aggregate(sales);const branches=BRANCHES.map((name,b)=>({name,b,...aggregate(filteredSales(b))})).sort((x,y)=>y.sales-x.sales);const active=branches.filter(x=>x.orders);const avg=active.length?active.reduce((n,x)=>n+x.sales,0)/active.length:0;const top=topProducts(sales);const days=state.period==='today'?1:state.period==='30d'?30:7;const prior=state.sales.filter(s=>s.date>=dateDaysAgo(days*2-1)&&s.date<=dateDaysAgo(days)&&(owner&&state.branch===-1||s.branch===state.branch));const pa=aggregate(prior);const change=pa.sales?Math.round((a.sales-pa.sales)/pa.sales*100):null;
 const weak=branches.slice().sort((x,y)=>x.sales-y.sales).slice(0,3);
 const branchBlock=owner&&state.branch===-1?`<section class="panel branches-panel"><div class="panel-header"><div><div class="panel-title">Branch performance</div><div class="panel-subtitle">Revenue by branch · ${state.period==='today'?'today':state.period==='30d'?'last 30 days':'last 7 days'}</div></div><button class="text-link" data-action="branches">Compare all →</button></div>${branches.slice(0,6).map((b,i)=>`<div class="branch-row"><span class="branch-rank">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div class="branch-info"><strong>${esc(b.name)}</strong><small>${b.orders} orders · ${b.units} items</small></div><div class="branch-sales">${money(b.sales)}<small>${avg?Math.round(b.sales/avg*100):0}% of avg</small></div></div>`).join('')}</section>`:`<section class="panel branches-panel"><div class="panel-header"><div><div class="panel-title">Branch snapshot</div><div class="panel-subtitle">Current branch performance</div></div><span class="badge">Active</span></div><div class="branch-row"><span class="branch-rank">⌂</span><div class="branch-info"><strong>${esc(BRANCHES[state.branch])}</strong><small>${a.orders} orders · ${a.units} items sold</small></div><div class="branch-sales">${money(a.sales)}<small>Gross profit ${money(a.sales-a.cost)}</small></div></div><div class="note" style="margin:14px 0 0">Company wide comparisons are available to the owner account.</div></section>`;
 return `<section class="food-hero"><div class="food-hero-copy"><span class="food-kicker">${owner?'THE HARVEST TABLE · COMPANY VIEW':'FRESH TODAY · '+esc(BRANCHES[state.branch])}</span><h1>${owner?'Good food, growing<br>business.':'A fresh look at<br>today’s service.'}</h1><p>${owner?'Track sales, branch health, and the dishes guests come back for.':'See what is selling and how your branch is doing.'}</p><div class="food-hero-actions"><button class="btn btn-dark" data-action="checkout">＋ Start a sale</button><button class="hero-link" data-action="sales">Explore sales <span>↗</span></button></div></div><div class="food-hero-image" role="img" aria-label="Freshly prepared colourful meal"><span class="hero-image-label"><b>Made fresh</b><small>Good food, served well</small></span></div><div class="hero-index"><span>01</span><i></i><span>HARVEST / POS</span></div></section>${pageTitle(owner?'COMPANY OVERVIEW':'BRANCH OVERVIEW',owner?'Today at Harvest':'Today at your branch',owner?'Your performance, branch by branch.':'Sales, product costs, and popular menu items.',`<button class="btn" data-action="export">↓ Export</button><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="checkout">＋ New sale</button>`)}
 <div class="filter-row"><span class="filter-label">Showing</span>${periodFilter()}${owner?`<select class="select" id="branchFilter"><option value="-1" ${state.branch===-1?'selected':''}>All branches</option>${BRANCHES.map((b,i)=>`<option value="${i}" ${state.branch===i?'selected':''}>${esc(b)}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:`<span class="badge gray">${esc(BRANCHES[state.branch])}</span>`}${sales.some(s=>s.demo)?'<span class="badge orange">Includes sample sales</span>':''}</div>
 <div class="metric-grid">${metric('Total sales',money(a.sales),change===null?'No prior-period comparison':`<span class="trend">${change>=0?'↑':'↓'} ${Math.abs(change)}%</span> vs previous ${days} day${days===1?'':'s'}`,'↗',sparkline(dayTotals(sales).map(d=>d.sales)))}${metric('Gross profit',money(a.sales-a.cost),'Sales less recorded product costs · '+money(a.cost)+' costs','◎',sparkline(dayTotals(sales).map(d=>d.sales-d.cost)))}${metric('Items sold',a.units,'Across '+a.orders+' completed orders','▦',sparkline(dayTotals(sales).map(d=>d.units)))}${metric(owner?'Active branches':'Average order',owner?`${active.length} / 20`:money(a.orders?a.sales/a.orders:0),owner?'With sales in this period':'Per completed sale','⌂',sparkline(dayTotals(sales).map(d=>d.orders)))}</div>
 <div class="dashboard-grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><div><div class="panel-title">Sales &amp; gross profit</div><div class="panel-subtitle">Daily performance · ${owner?'all branches':'this branch'}</div></div><div class="legend"><span><i></i>Sales</span><span><i class="light"></i>Gross profit</span></div></div>${salesChart(sales)}</section>${branchBlock}</div>
 ${owner&&weak.length?`<div class="note">Lowest sales this period: ${weak.map(b=>`${esc(b.name)} (${money(b.sales)})`).join(' · ')}. Compare branches using sales, orders, items sold, and gross profit; sales alone don’t account for branch size or operating costs.</div>`:''}
 <section class="panel table-panel"><div class="table-heading"><div><div class="table-title">Best sellers</div><div class="table-subtitle">Ranked by quantity sold · ${owner&&state.branch===-1?'across all branches':esc(BRANCHES[state.branch])}</div></div><button class="text-link" data-action="sales">View sales history →</button></div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Units sold</th><th>Sales value</th><th>Gross profit</th></tr></thead><tbody>${top.length?productTableRows(top):`<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">No sales in this period.</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></section>`
}
function checkout(){
 const products=branchProducts().filter(p=>p.available);const cats=['All',...new Set(products.map(p=>p.category))];const shown=state.category==='All'?products:products.filter(p=>p.category===state.category);const items=state.cart.map(c=>{const p=product(c.id);return p?{...p,qty:c.qty}:null}).filter(Boolean);const subtotal=items.reduce((n,p)=>n+p.price*p.qty,0);const count=items.reduce((n,p)=>n+p.qty,0);const offline=!navigator.onLine,branchChosen=state.branch>=0;if(offline&&state.paymentMethod!=='Cash'){state.paymentMethod='Cash';state.paymentRef=''}const paymentMethod=state.paymentMethod||'Cash',onlinePayment=paymentMethod!=='Cash';
 return `${pageTitle('POINT OF SALE','New sale',`${branchChosen?esc(BRANCHES[state.branch]):'Select a branch'} · ${state.role==='Owner'?'Owner view':state.user}`,`<button class="btn" data-action="sales">Sales history →</button>`)}${!branchChosen?`<div class="offline-banner">Choose a branch from the top-right branch selector before starting checkout.</div>`:''}${offline?`<div class="offline-banner"><span>●</span><span>Offline mode: cash sales can be saved on this device. Online payment methods are unavailable offline.</span></div>`:''}<div class="checkout-layout"><section><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px"><input class="input search" id="productSearch" placeholder="Search products..."/><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px">${products.length} available</span></div><div class="category-pills">${cats.map(c=>`<button class="pill ${state.category===c?'active':''}" data-category="${esc(c)}">${esc(c)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="product-grid">${shown.map(p=>`<button class="sell-product" data-add="${p.id}"><span class="emoji">${p.emoji}</span><strong>${esc(p.name)}</strong><small>${esc(p.category)}</small><b>${money(p.price)}</b></button>`).join('')||`<div class="empty">No products found.</div>`}</div></section><aside class="panel cart-panel"><div class="cart-head"><h2>Current order</h2><small>${count} item${count===1?'':'s'}</small></div><div class="form-row channel-select"><label for="orderChannel">Order type</label><select class="select" id="orderChannel">${['Counter','Takeaway','Table service','Delivery'].map(c=>`<option ${state.orderChannel===c?'selected':''}>${c}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="form-row channel-select"><label for="paymentMethod">Payment method</label><select class="select" id="paymentMethod">${['Cash','Card','Bank transfer','USSD'].map(method=>`<option value="${method}" ${paymentMethod===method?'selected':''} ${offline&&method!=='Cash'?'disabled':''}>${method}${method==='Cash'&&offline?' · offline':''}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>${onlinePayment?`<span class="badge gray payment-gateway-status" id="paymentGatewayStatus">Checking gateway…</span><div class="form-row" id="paystackEmailRow" hidden><label for="paymentEmail">Customer email for Paystack</label><input class="input" id="paymentEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="customer@example.com" value="${esc(state.paymentEmail||'')}"></div><div class="form-row" id="externalReferenceRow"><label for="paymentRef">External payment reference</label><input class="input" id="paymentRef" maxlength="80" placeholder="Enter reference after external payment" value="${esc(state.paymentRef||'')}"></div><div class="note payment-note" id="paymentHelp">If Paystack is configured, customer email and sale amount are sent to Paystack when you start checkout. Otherwise, complete payment externally, enter its reference, then confirm receipt in Sales History. Unverified sales stay out of reports.</div>`:''}<div class="cart-items">${items.length?items.map(p=>`<div class="cart-item"><span class="product-thumb">${p.emoji}</span><div class="cart-item-info"><strong>${esc(p.name)}</strong><small>${money(p.price)} each</small></div><div class="qty-control"><button data-qty="${p.id}" data-delta="-1">−</button><span>${p.qty}</span><button data-qty="${p.id}" data-delta="1">+</button></div></div>`).join(''):`<div class="cart-empty">Your order is empty.<br/>Choose a product to get started.</div>`}</div><div class="cart-summary"><div class="summary-line"><span>Subtotal</span><strong>${money(subtotal)}</strong></div><div class="summary-line"><span>Tax</span><span>Not configured</span></div><div class="summary-line total"><span>Total</span><span>${money(subtotal)}</span></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary complete-sale" data-action="complete" ${!items.length||!branchChosen||onlinePayment?'disabled':''}>${onlinePayment?'Checking payment method…':'Complete cash sale'} · ${money(subtotal)}</button><div class="hint">${onlinePayment?'Online payments use a gateway or manual verification.':'Product cost is captured with each sale for historical gross profit.'}</div></aside></div>`
}
function saleRows(sales){return sales.slice().sort((a,b)=>b.createdAt.localeCompare(a.createdAt)).map(s=>`<tr><td><span class="nowrap">${esc(s.id)}</span><small style="display:block;color:#9ba59f;margin-top:3px">${s.demo?'Sample sale':''}</small></td><td>${fmtDate(s.date)}<small style="display:block;color:#9ba59f;margin-top:3px">${new Date(s.createdAt).toLocaleTimeString('en-NG',{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})}</small></td><td>${esc(BRANCHES[s.branch])}</td><td>${esc(s.channel)}</td><td>${s.items.reduce((n,i)=>n+i.qty,0)} items</td><td>${money(s.total)}</td><td><span class="badge">${esc(s.payment)}</span>${s.paymentReference?`<small class="reference-text">${esc(s.paymentReference)}</small>`:''}</td><td>${s.paymentStatus==='pending'?`<span class="badge orange">Awaiting verification</span>${s.paymentProvider==='Paystack'?`<button class="text-link confirm-payment" data-verify-payment="${esc(s.id)}">Check Paystack</button>`:`<button class="text-link confirm-payment" data-mark-payment="${esc(s.id)}">Confirm received</button>`}`:`<span class="badge">${s.paymentStatus==='paid'?'Paid':'Complete'}</span>`}</td><td><span class="badge ${s.status==='pending'?'orange':''}">${s.demo?'Sample':s.status==='pending'?'Queued locally':s.status==='local'?'Saved locally':'Complete'}</span></td></tr>`).join('')}
function salesView(){const sales=filteredSales(state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?null:state.branch,true);return `${pageTitle('TRANSACTIONS','Sales history','Review sales, payment verification, and local sync status.',`<button class="btn" data-action="export">↓ Export CSV</button><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="checkout">＋ New sale</button>`)}<div class="filter-row">${periodFilter()}${state.role==='Owner'?`<select class="select" id="branchFilter"><option value="-1">All branches</option>${BRANCHES.map((b,i)=>`<option value="${i}" ${state.branch===i?'selected':''}>${esc(b)}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:''}<input class="input search" id="salesSearch" placeholder="Search sale or product"/><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px">${sales.length} transactions</span></div><section class="panel table-panel"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Sale ID</th><th>Date &amp; time</th><th>Branch</th><th>Channel</th><th>Items</th><th>Total</th><th>Payment</th><th>Payment status</th><th>Sync status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="salesRows">${sales.length?saleRows(sales):`<tr><td colspan="9" class="empty">No sales found for this period.</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></section>`}
function productsView(){
 const canEditPrice=state.role==='Branch Manager'||state.role==='Owner',canEditCost=canEditPrice||state.role==='Cashier';
 const canManage=canEditPrice,history=(state.auditLog||[]).filter(a=>a.branch===state.branch).slice(0,8);
 return `${pageTitle('CATALOGUE','Products & prices','One shared catalogue, with availability, price, and cost set for each branch.',canManage?`<button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="add-product">＋ Add product</button>`:'')}<div class="filter-row"><span class="badge gray">${esc(BRANCHES[state.branch])}</span><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px">Each sale keeps the price and cost recorded at checkout.</span></div>${state.role==='Cashier'?`<div class="note">Cashiers can update this branch’s unit costs. Changes take effect on future sales and are recorded in the activity history.</div>`:''}<div class="settings-grid">${branchProducts().map(p=>`<article class="product-card"><div class="product-card-top"><span class="product-thumb">${p.emoji}</span><div><h3>${esc(p.name)}</h3><p>${esc(p.category)} · Shared catalogue</p></div>${canManage?`<button class="icon-button" data-edit-product="${p.id}" title="Edit product">⋯</button>`:''}</div><div class="product-fields"><div class="field"><label>Branch price (₦)${p.samplePrice?' · sample':''}</label><input class="input" type="number" min="0" step="50" value="${p.price}" data-product-field="price" data-product-id="${p.id}" ${canEditPrice?'':'disabled'}></div><div class="field"><label>Unit cost (₦)${p.sampleCost?' · sample':''}</label><input class="input" type="number" min="0" step="50" value="${p.cost}" data-product-field="cost" data-product-id="${p.id}" ${canEditCost?'':'disabled'}></div></div><label class="product-status"><input type="checkbox" data-available="${p.id}" ${p.available?'checked':''} ${canManage?'':'disabled'}> Available at this branch</label></article>`).join('')}</div><section class="panel table-panel audit-panel"><div class="table-heading"><div><div class="table-title">Recent product changes</div><div class="table-subtitle">Local activity history for this branch</div></div></div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Who</th><th>Change</th><th>Product</th><th>Before</th><th>After</th></tr></thead><tbody>${history.length?history.map(h=>`<tr><td>${new Date(h.at).toLocaleString('en-NG',{dateStyle:'short',timeStyle:'short'})}</td><td>${esc(h.user)} · ${esc(h.role)}</td><td>${esc(h.field)}</td><td>${esc(h.product)}</td><td>${esc(h.oldValue)}</td><td>${esc(h.newValue)}</td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="6" class="empty">Product changes will be recorded here.</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></section>`
}
function branchesView(){const rows=BRANCHES.map((name,b)=>({name,b,...aggregate(filteredSales(b))}));const max=Math.max(...rows.map(r=>r.sales),1),avg=rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+r.sales,0)/20,hasSamples=filteredSales(null).some(s=>s.demo);return `${pageTitle('COMPANY PERFORMANCE','Branch comparison','Compare revenue alongside gross profit, order volume, average order value, and gross margin.',`<button class="btn" data-action="export">↓ Export</button>`)}<div class="filter-row">${periodFilter()}${hasSamples?'<span class="badge orange">Includes sample sales</span>':''}<span class="muted" style="font-size:10px">Gross profit = sales less recorded product costs. Operating expenses are not included; sales totals alone can favor larger branches.</span></div><div class="metric-grid">${metric('Company sales',money(rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+r.sales,0)),'Across 20 branches','↗')}${metric('Company gross profit',money(rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+r.sales-r.cost,0)),'After recorded product costs','◎')}${metric('Orders',rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+r.orders,0).toLocaleString(),'Completed sales','▤')}${metric('Active branches',`${rows.filter(r=>r.orders).length} / 20`,'With sales in this period','⌂')}</div><section class="panel table-panel"><div class="table-heading"><div><div class="table-title">All branches</div><div class="table-subtitle">Ranked by sales · Average sales ${money(avg)} · Compare order and margin measures too</div></div></div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Branch</th><th>Sales</th><th>Gross profit</th><th>Orders</th><th>Sales / order</th><th>Gross margin</th><th>Sales vs average</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.sort((a,b)=>b.sales-a.sales).map((r,i)=>`<tr><td><div class="product-cell"><span class="branch-rank">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span><strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong><small>Branch ${String(r.b+1).padStart(2,'0')} · ${r.units} items</small></span></div></td><td><strong>${money(r.sales)}</strong></td><td>${money(r.sales-r.cost)}</td><td>${r.orders}</td><td>${money(r.orders?r.sales/r.orders:0)}</td><td>${r.sales?Math.round((r.sales-r.cost)/r.sales*100):0}%</td><td><strong class="${r.sales<avg?'low-tag':''}">${avg?Math.round(r.sales/avg*100):0}%</strong><div class="branch-performance"><i style="width:${r.sales/max*100}%"></i></div></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></section>`}
function assistantScopeSales(){return filteredSales(state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?null:state.branch)}
function assistantAnalysis(){
 const current=assistantScopeSales(),days=state.period==='today'?1:state.period==='30d'?30:7;
 const previous=state.sales.filter(s=>s.date>=dateDaysAgo(days*2-1)&&s.date<=dateDaysAgo(days)&&(state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1||s.branch===state.branch));
 const now=aggregate(current),before=aggregate(previous),delta=before.sales?Math.round((now.sales-before.sales)/before.sales*100):null;
 const items=topProducts(current,Infinity).map(i=>({...i,margin:i.sales?i.profit/i.sales:0}));
 const low=items.filter(p=>p.sales&&p.margin<.25).sort((a,b)=>a.margin-b.margin);
 const branchRows=BRANCHES.map((name,b)=>({name,b,...aggregate(filteredSales(b))}));
 const bestBranch=branchRows.slice().sort((a,b)=>b.sales-a.sales)[0];
 const scope=state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?'all 20 branches':BRANCHES[state.branch];
 const trend=delta===null?'There is not enough prior-period data to compare sales.':delta>0?`Sales are up ${delta}% against the previous ${days} day${days===1?'':'s'}.`:delta<0?`Sales are down ${Math.abs(delta)}% against the previous ${days} day${days===1?'':'s'}.`:`Sales are level against the previous ${days} day${days===1?'':'s'}.`;
 const scopedProductLists=state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?state.products:[branchProducts()];
 const productSample=scopedProductLists.some(list=>list.some(p=>p.sampleCost||p.samplePrice));
 const cards=[{icon:'↗',title:'Sales trend',text:`${trend} Current period sales are ${money(now.sales)} across ${now.orders} sales.`},{icon:'◎',title:'Gross profit',text:`Recorded product costs are ${money(now.cost)}. Gross profit is ${money(now.sales-now.cost)} (${now.sales?Math.round((now.sales-now.cost)/now.sales*100):0}% of sales). This excludes rent, wages, utilities, tax, and other expenses.`}];
 if(items.length){cards.push({icon:'★',title:'Top seller by quantity',text:`${items[0].name} sold ${items[0].qty} units for ${money(items[0].sales)} in this period. Protect availability, then review its gross profit contribution before promoting discounts.`})}
 if(low.length){const p=low[0];cards.push({icon:'!',title:'Low gross margin to review',text:`${p.name} has a ${Math.round(p.margin*100)}% gross margin (${money(p.profit)} gross profit on ${money(p.sales)} sales). First verify the branch unit cost, then compare the selling price and competitor context before changing either.`})}
 else if(items.length){cards.push({icon:'✓',title:'Product margin check',text:'No sold product is below the prototype’s 25% gross-margin review threshold using recorded costs. This is a review flag, not an industry benchmark.'})}
 if(state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1&&bestBranch&&bestBranch.orders){cards.push({icon:'⌂',title:'Branch leader',text:`${bestBranch.name} leads this period with ${money(bestBranch.sales)} sales, ${bestBranch.orders} orders, and ${money(bestBranch.sales-bestBranch.cost)} gross profit. Compare order counts and profit alongside revenue.`})}
 return {scope,cards,items,now,before,delta,days,branchRows,productSample,sampleSales:current.some(s=>s.demo),sampleOnly:current.length>0&&current.every(s=>s.demo)};
}
function assistantView(){const a=assistantAnalysis();return `${pageTitle('SALES & PRODUCT COST INSIGHTS','Financial assistant','Clear, data-backed guidance for your selected branch and date range.',`<button class="btn" data-action="clear-samples">Clear sample sales</button><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="refresh-advice">↻ Refresh insights</button>`)}<div class="assistant-notice"><span class="assistant-mark">✳</span><div><strong>Advice based on ${esc(a.scope)} · ${state.period==='today'?'today':state.period==='30d'?'last 30 days':'last 7 days'}</strong><small>${a.productSample?'Sample product costs/prices are still present. Update them before relying on these calculations. ':'These calculations use recorded branch prices and costs. '}Gross profit is not net profit; operating expenses are not included.</small></div><span class="badge gray" id="assistantMode">Local analysis</span></div>${a.sampleSales?`<div class="note sample-warning">Sample sales are included in this view${a.sampleOnly?' and account for all displayed sales':''}. Clear them when you begin entering real transactions. Insights based on sample data are illustrative.</div>`:''}<div class="assistant-layout"><section><div class="assistant-section-head"><div><h2>What stands out</h2><p>Signals from your selected sales period</p></div><span class="badge">${a.cards.length} insights</span></div><div class="insight-grid">${a.cards.map(c=>`<article class="insight-card"><span class="insight-icon">${c.icon}</span><div><h3>${esc(c.title)}</h3><p>${esc(c.text)}</p></div></article>`).join('')}</div><section class="panel table-panel assistant-products"><div class="table-heading"><div><div class="table-title">Product performance</div><div class="table-subtitle">All sold products · quantity, sales, gross profit, and gross margin</div></div></div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Units</th><th>Sales</th><th>Gross profit</th><th>Margin</th></tr></thead><tbody>${a.items.length?a.items.map(i=>`<tr><td><div class="product-cell"><span class="product-thumb">${i.emoji}</span><span><strong>${esc(i.name)}</strong></span></div></td><td>${i.qty}</td><td>${money(i.sales)}</td><td>${money(i.profit)}</td><td>${Math.round(i.margin*100)}%</td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">No sales in this period.</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></section></section><aside class="panel ask-panel"><div class="assistant-avatar">✳</div><h2>Ask about your numbers</h2><p>Ask about sales, best sellers, product costs, gross profit, or branch comparisons. Suggestions use the selected branch and date range.</p><div class="suggestion-list"><button data-question="Which product sold the most?">Which product sold the most?</button><button data-question="Which products have the lowest gross margin?">Which products have the lowest gross margin?</button><button data-question="How are sales trending?">How are sales trending?</button>${state.role==='Owner'?`<button data-question="Compare the branches by sales and gross profit">Compare the branches by sales and gross profit</button>`:''}<button data-question="What price gives Party Jollof Rice a 30% gross margin?">Calculate a target-margin price</button></div><form id="assistantForm" class="assistant-form"><input class="input" name="question" placeholder="Ask a financial question..." aria-label="Ask a financial question" required maxlength="500"><button class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="Ask assistant">↑</button></form><div id="assistantAnswer" class="assistant-answer" hidden></div><div class="assistant-footnote">Local analysis works without internet. If AI is enabled, your question plus aggregated product performance, current branch prices/costs, and owner-visible branch totals are sent to the configured provider; individual sales and staff names are not sent. Guidance excludes operating expenses.</div></aside></div>`}
function answerQuestion(q){
 const a=assistantAnalysis(),text=String(q).toLowerCase(),scopeNote=a.sampleSales?' Sample sales are included, so treat this as illustrative.':'';
 const target=text.match(/(?:at|for|of)?\s*(\d{1,2})\s*%/);
 if(/price/.test(text)&&target){
   const pct=Number(target[1])/100;
   if(pct>0&&pct<.9){
     const candidates=state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?state.products.flatMap((list,b)=>list.map(p=>({...p,branch:b}))):branchProducts().map(p=>({...p,branch:state.branch}));
     const matches=candidates.filter(p=>text.includes(p.name.toLowerCase()));
     if(matches.length){
       const lines=matches.map(p=>{const calc=p.cost/(1-pct),suggested=Math.ceil(calc/50)*50;return `${BRANCHES[p.branch]}: cost ${money(p.cost)} → price about ${money(suggested)}`});
       return `${matches[0].name} at a ${Math.round(pct*100)}% gross margin target: ${lines.join('; ')}. Formula: unit cost ÷ (1 − target margin), rounded up to the next ₦50. This covers only recorded product cost, not operating expenses, tax, discounts, or demand. Verify the cost values first.${matches.some(p=>p.sampleCost)?' Some costs are sample data, so those calculations are illustrative.':''}`;
     }
   }
   return `I couldn't match a product name in that question. Include the exact product name and target margin (for example, “What price gives Party Jollof Rice a 30% gross margin?”).`;
 }
 if(/branch/.test(text)){
   if(state.role!=='Owner')return `You can see ${BRANCHES[state.branch]}'s sales and product costs here. Company-wide branch comparisons are available to the owner account.`;
   if(!a.branchRows.some(b=>b.orders))return 'There are no recorded branch sales in this period to compare.';
   const metric=/margin/.test(text)?'margin':/profit/.test(text)?'profit':'sales';
   const score=b=>metric==='margin'?(b.sales?(b.sales-b.cost)/b.sales:-Infinity):metric==='profit'?b.sales-b.cost:b.sales;
   const rows=a.branchRows.filter(b=>b.orders).sort((x,y)=>score(y)-score(x)),low=rows.at(-1),lead=rows[0];
   const leaderValue=metric==='sales'?`${money(lead.sales)} sales across ${lead.orders} orders`:metric==='profit'?`${money(lead.sales-lead.cost)} gross profit on ${money(lead.sales)} sales`:`${Math.round(score(lead)*100)}% gross margin`;
   const lowValue=metric==='sales'?money(low.sales):metric==='profit'?money(low.sales-low.cost):`${Math.round(score(low)*100)}%`;
   return `${lead.name} leads by ${metric==='profit'?'gross profit':metric==='margin'?'gross margin':'sales'}: ${leaderValue}. ${low.name} is lowest at ${lowValue}. Compare order volume as well; branch size and operating expenses are not included.${scopeNote}`;
 }
 if(/most|best|top|seller|selling|quantity|highest/.test(text)&&/product|item|sell|seller/.test(text)){
   const byValue=/value|revenue|sales/.test(text),productList=a.items.slice().sort((x,y)=>byValue?y.sales-x.sales:y.qty-x.qty);
   return productList.length?`${productList[0].name} is the top product by ${byValue?'sales value':'quantity'} in ${a.scope}: ${productList[0].qty} units sold for ${money(productList[0].sales)}, with ${money(productList[0].profit)} gross profit. ${productList[0].margin<.25?'Review its recorded unit cost and price before discounting.':'Protect availability and monitor its margin.'}${scopeNote}`:'There are no recorded product sales in this period.';
 }
 if(/margin|cost|price|profit/.test(text)){
   const items=a.items.slice().sort((x,y)=>x.margin-y.margin);if(!items.length)return 'There is no recorded sales and cost data for this period yet.';
   const low=items.filter(i=>i.margin<.25);
   return low.length?`Lowest gross margin is ${items[0].name} at ${Math.round(items[0].margin*100)}% (${money(items[0].profit)} gross profit on ${money(items[0].sales)} sales). Verify the branch cost first, then review price and demand before changing it. This excludes operating expenses.${scopeNote}`:`The lowest gross margin among products sold is ${items[0].name} at ${Math.round(items[0].margin*100)}%. No sold item is below the prototype’s 25% review threshold. That threshold is a prompt to investigate, not an industry standard.${scopeNote}`;
 }
 if(/trend|compare|change|previous|up|down/.test(text))return a.delta===null?'There is not enough prior-period data to calculate a trend.':`Sales are ${a.delta>0?'up '+a.delta+'%':a.delta<0?'down '+Math.abs(a.delta)+'%':'level'} against the previous ${a.days} day${a.days===1?'':'s'}: ${money(a.now.sales)} now versus ${money(a.before.sales)} before. Gross profit is ${money(a.now.sales-a.now.cost)}. Compare both order counts and product mix when interpreting the change.${scopeNote}`;
 return `For ${a.scope} in the selected period: sales ${money(a.now.sales)}, recorded product costs ${money(a.now.cost)}, gross profit ${money(a.now.sales-a.now.cost)}, ${a.now.orders} orders, and ${a.now.units} units sold. Gross profit is before operating expenses.${scopeNote}`;
}
function assistantContext(){const a=assistantAnalysis(),catalog=state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?state.products.flatMap((list,b)=>list.map(p=>({branch:BRANCHES[b],name:p.name,currentPrice:p.price,currentUnitCost:p.cost,available:p.available,sampleValues:p.samplePrice||p.sampleCost}))):branchProducts().map(p=>({branch:BRANCHES[state.branch],name:p.name,currentPrice:p.price,currentUnitCost:p.cost,available:p.available,sampleValues:p.samplePrice||p.sampleCost}));return {scope:a.scope,period:state.period,sampleSales:a.sampleSales,sampleProductValues:a.productSample,current:{sales:a.now.sales,recordedProductCosts:a.now.cost,grossProfit:a.now.sales-a.now.cost,orders:a.now.orders,units:a.now.units},previous:{sales:a.before.sales,orders:a.before.orders},salesChangePercent:a.delta,products:a.items.map(i=>({name:i.name,units:i.qty,sales:i.sales,grossProfit:i.profit,grossMarginPercent:Math.round(i.margin*100)})),currentBranchCatalogue:catalog,branches:state.role==='Owner'?a.branchRows.map(b=>({name:b.name,sales:b.sales,grossProfit:b.sales-b.cost,orders:b.orders,units:b.units})):undefined}}
async function updateAssistantMode(){const badge=document.getElementById('assistantMode');if(!badge)return;try{const response=await fetch('/api/status',{cache:'no-store'});const status=await response.json();badge.textContent=status.aiEnabled?'AI connected':'Local analysis';badge.title=status.aiEnabled?`Connected to ${status.model}`:'No AI server key configured; local answers work offline.'}catch{badge.textContent='Local analysis';badge.title='AI server unavailable; local answers work offline.'}}
async function askAssistant(question){const box=document.getElementById('assistantAnswer'),badge=document.getElementById('assistantMode');if(!box)return;box.hidden=false;box.textContent='Checking your sales summary…';try{const statusResponse=await fetch('/api/status',{cache:'no-store'});const status=await statusResponse.json();if(status.aiEnabled){badge.textContent='AI is thinking…';const response=await fetch('/api/assistant',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({question:String(question).slice(0,500),context:assistantContext()})});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'AI request failed.');box.textContent=result.answer;badge.textContent='AI answer';badge.title=`Generated with ${result.model||status.model}`;return}}catch{}box.textContent=answerQuestion(question);if(badge){badge.textContent='Local answer';badge.title='Rule-based answer from the selected POS data. An AI server can be enabled in server settings.'}}
function clearSampleSales(){if(!state.sales.some(s=>s.demo)){toast('There are no sample sales to clear.');return}if(!window.confirm('Remove illustrative sample sales from this browser? Real sales and product settings will be kept.'))return;state.sales=state.sales.filter(s=>!s.demo);save();render();toast('Sample sales cleared. Product prices and costs were kept.')}
function render(){if(state.view==='products'&&state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch<0)state.branch=0;setHeader();document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('active',n.dataset.view===state.view));const labels={overview:'Overview',checkout:'New sale',sales:'Sales history',products:'Products & prices',branches:'Branches',assistant:'Financial assistant'};document.getElementById('pageCrumb').textContent=labels[state.view]||'Overview';const views={overview,checkout,sales:salesView,products:productsView,branches:branchesView,assistant:assistantView};document.getElementById('viewRoot').innerHTML=(views[state.view]||overview)();bindDynamic();if(state.view==='assistant')updateAssistantMode();if(state.view==='checkout')updatePaymentGatewayMode()}
function toast(msg,type=''){const region=document.getElementById('toastRegion');const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='toast '+type;el.textContent=msg;region.append(el);setTimeout(()=>el.remove(),2800)}
function openModal(html){const d=document.getElementById('modal');document.getElementById('modalContent').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-body">${html}</div>`;d.showModal()}
function closeModal(){document.getElementById('modal').close()}
function addToCart(id){if(state.branch<0){toast('Choose a branch before starting a sale.','warn');return}const p=product(id);if(!p||!p.available)return;const line=state.cart.find(i=>i.id===id);if(line)line.qty++;else state.cart.push({id,qty:1});render()}
function changeQty(id,delta){const c=state.cart.find(i=>i.id===id);if(c)c.qty+=delta;state.cart=state.cart.filter(i=>i.qty>0);render()}
async function updatePaymentGatewayMode(){const badge=document.getElementById('paymentGatewayStatus'),emailRow=document.getElementById('paystackEmailRow'),referenceRow=document.getElementById('externalReferenceRow'),help=document.getElementById('paymentHelp'),button=document.querySelector('[data-action="complete"]');if(!badge||!button)return;let enabled=false;try{const response=await fetch('/api/status',{cache:'no-store'});if(response.ok)enabled=!!(await response.json()).paystackEnabled}catch{}if(!document.getElementById('paymentMethod'))return;badge.textContent=enabled?'Paystack checkout ready':'External payment recording';badge.className=`badge ${enabled?'green':'gray'} payment-gateway-status`;if(emailRow)emailRow.hidden=!enabled;if(referenceRow)referenceRow.hidden=enabled;if(help)help.textContent=enabled?'Customer email and sale amount are sent to Paystack to start checkout. The sale is counted only after Paystack confirms the exact amount.':'Complete payment through your terminal or bank, enter its reference, then confirm receipt in Sales History. Unverified sales stay out of reports.';button.textContent=`${enabled?'Pay with '+state.paymentMethod:'Record '+state.paymentMethod+' payment'} · ${money(state.cart.reduce((n,c)=>{const p=product(c.id);return n+(p?p.price*c.qty:0)},0))}`;button.disabled=!state.cart.length||state.branch<0||(enabled?!document.getElementById('paymentEmail')?.value.trim():!document.getElementById('paymentRef')?.value.trim())}
async function completeSale(){if(state.branch<0){toast('Choose a branch before completing a sale.','warn');return}if(!state.cart.length)return;const payment=state.paymentMethod||'Cash',isOnlinePayment=payment!=='Cash';if(isOnlinePayment&&!navigator.onLine){toast('Online payment methods are unavailable offline.','warn');return}const lines=state.cart.map(c=>{const p=product(c.id);return {productId:p.id,name:p.name,emoji:p.emoji,qty:c.qty,price:p.price,cost:p.cost}});const total=lines.reduce((n,i)=>n+i.price*i.qty,0);const id=`${BRANCHES[state.branch].slice(0,3).toUpperCase()}-${Date.now().toString(36).toUpperCase()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7).toUpperCase()}`;let reference='',provider='';if(isOnlinePayment){let enabled=false;try{const status=await fetch('/api/status',{cache:'no-store'});enabled=status.ok&&(await status.json()).paystackEnabled}catch{}if(enabled){const email=document.getElementById('paymentEmail')?.value.trim()||'';if(!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)){toast('Enter a valid customer email to start Paystack checkout.','warn');return}const button=document.querySelector('[data-action="complete"]');if(button){button.disabled=true;button.textContent='Starting secure checkout…'}try{const response=await fetch('/api/payments/initialize',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({email,amount:Math.round(total*100),reference:id,channel:payment})});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Could not start payment.');reference=result.reference;provider='Paystack';state.sales.push({id,branch:state.branch,date:todayISO(),createdAt:new Date().toISOString(),items:lines,subtotal:total,total,payment,paymentReference:reference,paymentProvider:provider,paymentStatus:'pending',channel:state.orderChannel||'Counter',status:'local',user:state.user,demo:false});state.cart=[];state.paymentMethod='Cash';state.paymentRef='';save();render();location.assign(result.authorizationUrl);return}catch(error){toast(error.message,'warn');if(button)button.disabled=false;return}}reference=(state.paymentRef||'').trim();if(!reference){toast('Enter the external payment reference before recording this sale.','warn');return}provider='Manual'}state.sales.push({id,branch:state.branch,date:todayISO(),createdAt:new Date().toISOString(),items:lines,subtotal:total,total,payment,paymentReference:reference,paymentProvider:provider,paymentStatus:isOnlinePayment?'pending':'paid',channel:state.orderChannel||'Counter',status:navigator.onLine?'local':'pending',user:state.user,demo:false});state.cart=[];state.paymentMethod='Cash';state.paymentRef='';save();render();toast(isOnlinePayment?'Payment recorded as awaiting verification. Verify the provider receipt before confirming it.':navigator.onLine?'Cash sale saved on this device.':'Offline cash sale queued on this device.',isOnlinePayment||!navigator.onLine?'warn':'')}
function confirmPaymentReceived(id){const sale=state.sales.find(s=>s.id===id&&s.paymentStatus==='pending'&&s.paymentProvider!=='Paystack');if(!sale)return;sale.paymentStatus='paid';sale.paymentConfirmedAt=new Date().toISOString();sale.paymentConfirmedBy=state.user;save();render();toast(`${sale.payment} payment confirmed. Sale is now included in reports.`)}
async function verifyPaystackPayment(id){const sale=state.sales.find(s=>s.id===id&&s.paymentStatus==='pending'&&s.paymentProvider==='Paystack');if(!sale)return;try{const response=await fetch(`/api/payments/verify?reference=${encodeURIComponent(sale.paymentReference)}`,{cache:'no-store'});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok||!result.paid||result.amount!==Math.round(sale.total*100)||result.currency!=='NGN'){toast('Paystack has not verified the exact sale amount. It remains pending.','warn');return}sale.paymentStatus='paid';sale.paymentConfirmedAt=new Date().toISOString();sale.paymentConfirmedBy='Paystack verification';save();render();toast('Paystack payment verified. Sale is now included in reports.')}catch{toast('Could not reach Paystack verification. The sale remains pending.','warn')}}
function makeCSV(){const all=filteredSales(state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?null:state.branch,true);const rows=[['Sale ID','Date','Branch','Channel','Payment method','Payment reference','Payment status','Product','Quantity','Unit price','Unit cost at sale','Gross profit','Local save status','Sample record']];all.forEach(s=>s.items.forEach(i=>rows.push([s.id,s.date,BRANCHES[s.branch],s.channel,s.payment,s.paymentReference||'',s.paymentStatus||'paid',i.name,i.qty,i.price,i.cost,(i.price-i.cost)*i.qty,s.status,s.demo?'Yes':'No'])));return rows.map(r=>r.map(v=>'"'+String(v).replaceAll('"','""')+'"').join(',')).join('\r\n')}
function exportCSV(){const blob=new Blob([makeCSV()],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'});const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download='harvest-pos-sales.csv';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);toast('Sales report downloaded.')}
function syncSales(){toast('The app has no sync server yet. Offline sales remain safely queued in this browser.','warn')}
function bindDynamic(){
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{const a=el.dataset.action;if(a==='checkout')setView('checkout');if(a==='sales')setView('sales');if(a==='branches')setView('branches');if(a==='export')exportCSV();if(a==='complete')completeSale();if(a==='add-product')openProductModal();if(a==='refresh-advice')render();if(a==='clear-samples')clearSampleSales()}));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-add]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>addToCart(el.dataset.add)));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-qty]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>changeQty(el.dataset.qty,Number(el.dataset.delta))));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-category]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.category=el.dataset.category;render()}));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-question]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>askAssistant(el.dataset.question)));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-product-field]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('change',()=>{const p=branchProducts().find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.productId);if(!p)return;const field=el.dataset.productField,old=Number(p[field]),val=Math.max(0,Number(el.value)||0);p[field]=val;if(field==='cost')p.sampleCost=false;else p.samplePrice=false;logChange('updated',p.name,field,old,val);save();toast(`${field==='cost'?'Cost':'Price'} updated for ${p.name}. New sales will use ${money(val)}.`)}));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-available]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('change',()=>{const p=branchProducts().find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.available);if(p){const old=p.available;p.available=el.checked;logChange('changed availability',p.name,'available',old,p.available);save();toast(`${p.name} marked ${p.available?'available':'unavailable'} at this branch.`)}}));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-edit-product]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{const p=product(el.dataset.editProduct);if(p)openProductModal(p)}));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-mark-payment]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>confirmPaymentReceived(el.dataset.markPayment)));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-verify-payment]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>verifyPaystackPayment(el.dataset.verifyPayment)));
 const af=document.getElementById('assistantForm');if(af)af.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();askAssistant(new FormData(af).get('question'));af.reset()});
 const channel=document.getElementById('orderChannel');if(channel)channel.addEventListener('change',()=>{state.orderChannel=channel.value;save()});
 const payment=document.getElementById('paymentMethod');if(payment)payment.addEventListener('change',()=>{state.paymentMethod=payment.value;state.paymentRef='';render()});
 const paymentRef=document.getElementById('paymentRef');if(paymentRef)paymentRef.addEventListener('input',()=>{state.paymentRef=paymentRef.value;updatePaymentGatewayMode()});
 const paymentEmail=document.getElementById('paymentEmail');if(paymentEmail)paymentEmail.addEventListener('input',updatePaymentGatewayMode);
 const period=document.getElementById('periodSelect');if(period)period.addEventListener('change',()=>{state.period=period.value;render()});
 const branch=document.getElementById('branchFilter');if(branch)branch.addEventListener('change',()=>{state.branch=Number(branch.value);render()});
 const search=document.getElementById('productSearch');if(search)search.addEventListener('input',()=>{const q=search.value.toLowerCase();document.querySelectorAll('.sell-product').forEach(c=>c.style.display=c.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q)?'':'none')});
 const ss=document.getElementById('salesSearch');if(ss)ss.addEventListener('input',()=>{const q=ss.value.toLowerCase();const list=filteredSales(state.role==='Owner'&&state.branch===-1?null:state.branch,true).filter(s=>s.id.toLowerCase().includes(q)||s.items.some(i=>i.name.toLowerCase().includes(q)));document.getElementById('salesRows').innerHTML=list.length?saleRows(list):`<tr><td colspan="9" class="empty">No matching sales.</td></tr>`})
}
function openProductModal(p=null){if(state.role==='Cashier'){toast('Only branch managers can add or rename shared products.','warn');return}if(!p&&state.branch<0){state.branch=0;save();render()}const currentBranch=Math.max(0,state.branch);openModal(`<div class="modal-head"><h2>${p?'Edit product':'Add product'}</h2><button class="modal-close" data-close>×</button></div><p class="modal-desc">This product appears in the shared company catalogue. Prices and costs are always set per branch.</p><form id="productForm"><div class="form-row"><label>Product name</label><input class="input" name="name" required value="${p?esc(p.name):''}" placeholder="e.g. Chicken pie"></div><div class="form-row"><label>Category</label><select class="select" name="category"><option ${p?.category==='Meals'?'selected':''}>Meals</option><option ${p?.category==='Packaged'?'selected':''}>Packaged</option><option ${p?.category==='Drinks'?'selected':''}>Drinks</option><option ${p?.category==='Sides'?'selected':''}>Sides</option></select></div><div class="form-row"><label>Emoji icon</label><input class="input" name="emoji" value="${p?esc(p.emoji):'🍽️'}" maxlength="4"></div>${p?'':`<div class="form-row"><label>Starting price at ${esc(BRANCHES[currentBranch])} (₦)</label><input class="input" name="price" type="number" min="1" step="50" required></div><div class="form-row"><label>Starting unit cost at ${esc(BRANCHES[currentBranch])} (₦)</label><input class="input" name="cost" type="number" min="0" step="50" required></div><div class="note">Other branches will see this product as unavailable until they enter their own price and cost.</div>`}<div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="btn" data-close>Cancel</button><button class="btn btn-primary">${p?'Save changes':'Add product'}</button></div></form>`);document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',closeModal));document.getElementById('productForm').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(e.target);if(p){const old=p.name;p.name=fd.get('name');p.category=fd.get('category');p.emoji=fd.get('emoji');for(const b of state.products){const q=b.find(x=>x.id===p.id);if(q){q.name=p.name;q.category=p.category;q.emoji=p.emoji}}logChange('edited catalogue',p.name,'name',old,p.name)}else{const id='p'+Date.now();state.products.forEach((list,i)=>list.push({id,name:fd.get('name'),category:fd.get('category'),emoji:fd.get('emoji'),price:i===currentBranch?Number(fd.get('price')):0,cost:i===currentBranch?Number(fd.get('cost')):0,samplePrice:false,sampleCost:false,available:i===currentBranch}));logChange('added product',fd.get('name'),'catalogue','—',BRANCHES[currentBranch])}save();closeModal();render();toast(p?'Product details updated.':'Product added; other branches need to configure it.')})}
function showBranchPicker(){const choices=state.role==='Owner'?[{name:'All branches',b:-1},...BRANCHES.map((name,b)=>({name,b}))]:[{name:BRANCHES[state.branch],b:state.branch}];openModal(`<div class="modal-head"><h2>${state.role==='Owner'?'Switch branch':'Assigned branch'}</h2><button class="modal-close" data-close>×</button></div><p class="modal-desc">Branch managers and cashiers are limited to their assigned branch. The owner can view all branches.</p><div class="branch-list">${choices.map(x=>`<button class="branch-card ${state.branch===x.b?'selected':''}" data-choose-branch="${x.b}"><span class="branch-rank">⌂</span><span class="branch-card-info"><strong>${esc(x.name)}</strong><small>${x.b===-1?'Company wide view':'Branch '+String(x.b+1).padStart(2,'0')}</small></span>${state.branch===x.b?'<span class="check">✓</span>':''}</button>`).join('')}</div>`);document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',closeModal));document.querySelectorAll('[data-choose-branch]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.branch=Number(b.dataset.chooseBranch);closeModal();render();save()}))}
function showProfileMenu(){const roles=['Owner','Branch Manager','Cashier'];openModal(`<div class="modal-head"><h2>Switch demo role</h2><button class="modal-close" data-close>×</button></div><p class="modal-desc">Preview the prototype’s role permissions. In a real deployment, roles must come from authenticated accounts.</p><div class="branch-list">${roles.map(r=>`<button class="branch-card ${state.role===r?'selected':''}" data-role="${r}"><span class="avatar">${r==='Owner'?'CO':r==='Cashier'?'TA':'AM'}</span><span class="branch-card-info"><strong>${r}</strong><small>${r==='Owner'?'Company reports and branch comparison':r==='Branch Manager'?'Branch operations, prices, and costs':r==='Cashier'?'Checkout and direct branch cost updates':'Checkout and branch cost entry'}</small></span>${state.role===r?'<span class="check">✓</span>':''}</button>`).join('')}</div>`);document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',closeModal));document.querySelectorAll('[data-role]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.role=b.dataset.role;state.user=state.role==='Owner'?'Chinedu O.':state.role==='Cashier'?'Tomi A.':'Adaeze M.';if(state.role!=='Owner')state.branch=0;closeModal();render();save()}))}
document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>setView(el.dataset.view)));document.getElementById('branchSwitch').addEventListener('click',showBranchPicker);document.getElementById('profileButton').addEventListener('click',showProfileMenu);document.getElementById('syncButton').addEventListener('click',syncSales);window.addEventListener('online',render);window.addEventListener('offline',render);document.getElementById('modal').addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.id==='modal')closeModal()});
if('serviceWorker'in navigator&&location.protocol.startsWith('http'))navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js').catch(()=>{});
render();
